OL,3,GNEWSAAngel Tube station to become
OL,4,Aexit-only at weekends
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngel Tube station will become
OL,7,Fexit-only at weekends from 2 January,
OL,8,Fas Transport for London works to extend
OL,9,Fthe life of the longest escalators on
OL,10,Fthe Underground network.
OL,12,FThe station's banks of escalators are
OL,13,F35 years old, with the set linking the
OL,14,Fmid-concourse and platform level
OL,15,Fstretching more than 60m and rising 27m
OL,16,Fvertically.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1793188563
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAngel Tube station to become
OL,4,Aexit-only at weekends
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Jones, director of asset
OL,7,Fperformance delivery for London
OL,8,FUnderground, said: "Their size means
OL,9,Frenewal or replacement is a
OL,10,Fchallenging, expensive project and we
OL,11,Fare currently exploring all options
OL,12,Fpossible to extend their working life."
OL,14,FTfL said "the legacy of historic
OL,15,Fshortfalls in government funding" had
OL,16,Fprevented investment in new escalators
OL,17,Fat the station.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
